  "body": "Otherwise if A (with policy) embeds B and B opens a popup B, the initial about:blank in the popup won't have a policy from A.\r\n\r\nThis was found in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1579012.\r\n\r\nAdding @bzbarsky as this means inheriting from creator's top-level browsing context's active document, which isn't great. Alternatively we could copy cross-origin opener-policy down into embedded documents so that a creator always has one, but then we'd have to store the origin on it as well.",
